{"title":"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Inequalities)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Inequalities)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Omegalearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Omegalearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Steph scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> baskets out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> attempts in the first half of a game, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> baskets out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> attempts in the second half. Candace took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> attempts in the first half and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> attempts in the second. In each half, Steph scored a higher percentage of baskets than Candace. Surprisingly they ended with the same overall percentage of baskets scored. How many more baskets did Candace score in the second half than in the first? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/a/42aefbe42671b2aeb0b90d88e171e5e03a00b73e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(7cm); draw((-8,27)--(72,27)); draw((16,0)--(16,35)); draw((40,0)--(40,35)); label(&quot;12&quot;, (28,3)); draw((25,6.5)--(25,12)--(31,12)--(31,6.5)--cycle); draw((25,5.5)--(31,5.5)); label(&quot;18&quot;, (56,3)); draw((53,6.5)--(53,12)--(59,12)--(59,6.5)--cycle); draw((53,5.5)--(59,5.5)); draw((53,5.5)--(59,5.5)); label(&quot;20&quot;, (28,18)); label(&quot;15&quot;, (28,24)); draw((25,21)--(31,21)); label(&quot;10&quot;, (56,18)); label(&quot;10&quot;, (56,24)); draw((53,21)--(59,21)); label(&quot;First Half&quot;, (28,31)); label(&quot;Second Half&quot;, (56,31)); label(&quot;Candace&quot;, (2.35,6)); label(&quot;Steph&quot;, (0,21)); [/asy]\" width=\"332\" height=\"148\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89c22e2134257867ed57c420ffad70bffabd4f84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 7\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 8\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 9\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 10\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Inequalities.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Inequalities)\">Solution 1 (Inequalities)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Inequalities)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of shots that Candace made in the first half, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the number of shots Candace made in the second half. Since Candace and Steph took the same number of attempts, with an equal percentage of baskets scored, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b9b8dc00dc791ce8c3a94a15cc152948b9a7c3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=10+15=25.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"17\" /> In addition, we have the following inequalities: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/6/716a42f88961e64e0d35c406547f428f6f675fe6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{12}&lt;\\frac{15}{20} \\implies x&lt;9,\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/3/a33cc629e050ccf31e08c13b068e5dd97ddd5290.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{y}{18}&lt;\\frac{10}{10} \\implies y&lt;18.\\]\" width=\"171\" height=\"37\" /> Pairing this up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f1e88cb7d47305cfe18e39880ae12a1ff1b656.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> we see the <i><b>only</b></i> possible solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/a/08ad62c74572bbac42836d52768fc2714754e56a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)=(8,17),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" /> for an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/8/328a3dcf6c9ee68c73feab923af436524fbeb86f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17-8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"136\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~wamofan\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Clearly, Steph made <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433a2d00206e4a772870528746f50abb1f98bf54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 + 10 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" /> shots in total. Also, due to parity reasons, the difference between the amount of shots Candace made in the first and second half must be odd. Thus, we can just test 7, 9, and 11, and after doing so we find that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80b2554df0a190907d45b08ee115a5f801d52801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"62\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Steph made 75 percent of his shots in the first half. He makes all of his shots in the second half. The most baskets Candace could have made in the first half is 8 baskets. The most she could have made in the second half is 17 baskets. Steph makes 25 and misses 5 baskets and the only way for Candace to make 25 shots is to make 8 in the first half and 17 in the second. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/0/d30ac875aeae117b89a641e302be2eacb5f0dc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17 - 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"136\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=gkFZrlmVOdkOwwTT&amp;t=3793\">~Math-X</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=2659\">~hsnacademy</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/MKzyAvby_HQ\">https://youtu.be/MKzyAvby_HQ</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything</i>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/QF9iZEjQ4AI\">https://youtu.be/QF9iZEjQ4AI</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Omegalearn\">Video Solution by Omegalearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Omegalearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//youtu.be/DzQZtQvNDwA?t=460\">~ Omegalearn</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IbsSecIq8FE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IbsSecIq8FE</a>\n</p><p>~Mathematical Dexterity\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions_2\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ij9pAy6tQSg?t=1995\">https://youtu.be/Ij9pAy6tQSg?t=1995</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0orAAUaLIO0\">https://youtu.be/0orAAUaLIO0</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nXHHM1884Jo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nXHHM1884Jo</a>   \n</p><p>~David\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/diWioLTXpYk\">https://youtu.be/diWioLTXpYk</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/whhYwdae